School finance-model recalibration-2. 25LSO-0674, 1.1
FISCAL NOTE
This bill contains an appropriation of $800,000 from the GENERAL FUND to the
Legislative Service Office. This appropriation is effective immediately.
This bill contains an appropriation of $120,000 from the GENERAL FUND to the
Legislative Service Office. This appropriation is effective immediately.
