GENERAL FUND $800,000
GENERAL FUND $120,000
Description of appropriation:
The $800,000 appropriation will fund the model recalibration study in accordance
with section 1 of the bill. It is anticipated this appropriation would be
expended in FY 2026.
The $120,000 appropriation will be expended for the payment of salary, per diem
and mileage for the twelve legislators appointed to the task force. The above
estimate assumes two meetings in FY 2025 and four meetings in FY 2026.
